{"body_markdown":"","change_reason":"2026-09-17 AI依据已保存正文和固定结果补写独立阅读所需背景、定义、经过及边界；不新增实验，不改变科学确认状态。","content_hash":"d8d4bc856c3d005cdccd2c9cdd5088bbd0d9cfbbf06a758019b2f94815190334","created_at":"2026-09-08T22:09:00.547490Z","created_by":{"id":"codex-development-agent-default-skill-acceptance","kind":"ai"},"discovery":"workspace_summary","keywords":["浮点求和","数值稳定性","detail"],"kind":"detail","level":"L1","owner_id":"RES-FLOATING-POINT-SUMMATION","payload":{"blocks":[{"block_id":"standalone-context","markdown":"## 本条问题、比较条件与判据\n\n本研究比较有限精度求和在“大数与小量共存，随后正负大数抵消”的输入上是否丢失小量。输入是保存脚本实际接收的有限 binary64（53位有效精度的双精度浮点）数，均无量纲；原复核环境为 CPython 3.12.10、Windows 11 x64。\n\n参考值把每个实际浮点输入精确转换为有理数后相加。记输入为 $x_i$（$i=1,\\ldots,n$，$n$为项数）、算法返回值为 $\\widehat S$，则\n\n$$S_{\\rm ref}=\\sum_{i=1}^{n}\\operatorname{Fraction}(x_i),\\qquad e_{\\rm abs}=\\left|\\operatorname{Fraction}(\\widehat S)-S_{\\rm ref}\\right|.$$\n\n`Fraction`表示精确有理数转换；“精确命中”指绝对误差 $e_{\\rm abs}=0$，不使用容差。这只检查已表示浮点数的求和误差，不混入十进制文本转换误差。\n\n显式逐项累加从0开始按顺序加每个输入，每次加法立即舍入。Kahan把上步丢失量保存在补偿变量中，下一步先修正输入；Neumaier按当前和与输入的幅值选择校正式，并把累计校正在末尾加入。`math.fsum`是Python标准库的求和对照，本研究只核对其返回值，没有采集内部轨迹。\n\n方法依据：浮点求和方法：精确基准、递推与适用条件，MEM-4acc73bb-59c7-560d-9415-fd42e9dcaa2d r1。原实验输入、结果及图表的固定来源保持在本条 evidence_refs 中。","requires_block_ids":[],"role":"introduction"},{"block_id":"inputs","markdown":"## 设计与输入\n\n先比较1000个单位增量放在大数之前或之后的差别，再加入一个负大数观察抵消。三种输入如下。本轮只运行显式逐项累加与math.fsum，未比较Kahan或Neumaier。\n\n| 样本 | 输入构造 | 项数 | 精确参考值 |\n|---|---|---:|---:|\n| 大数先加 | $[10^{16},1,\\ldots,1]$，1000个1 | 1001 | 10000000000001000 |\n| 小量先加 | $[1,\\ldots,1,10^{16}]$，1000个1 | 1001 | 10000000000001000 |\n| 小量后抵消 | $[10^{16},1,\\ldots,1,-10^{16}]$，1000个1 | 1002 | 1000 |","requires_block_ids":["standalone-context"],"role":"inputs"},{"block_id":"trace","markdown":"## 小量在哪一步丢失\n\n本机实测`math.ulp(1e16)=2`，而`1e16 + 1`仍返回`1e16`。按共同方法中的逐项递推，大数先加时每次加入1均未改变当前和。损失发生在沿途每一步，并非最终输出时才统一丢掉1000。\n\n| 大数先加或随后抵消的关键位置 | 当前浮点和 | 精确前缀和 | 有符号误差 |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|\n| 输入大数后 | 10000000000000000 | 10000000000000000 | 0 |\n| 再输入第1个1 | 10000000000000000 | 10000000000000001 | −1 |\n| 再输入第1000个1 | 10000000000000000 | 10000000000001000 | −1000 |\n| 抵消样本最后减去大数 | 0 | 1000 | −1000 |\n\n小量先加则先得到1000，再计算大数加1000。本次返回值可以表示，并与精确有理数参考值一致。最后加入负大数也不会恢复已经在前面舍入掉的小量，因此第三种输入返回0而非1000。","requires_block_ids":["inputs"],"role":"discussion"},{"block_id":"results","markdown":"## 结果\n\n这里沿用独立方法章中的绝对误差：算法输出与实际浮点输入的精确有理数和之差的绝对值，单位为无量纲。\n\n| 方法 | 精确命中/样本数 | 最大绝对误差 |\n|---|---:|---:|\n| 显式逐项累加 | 1/3 | 1000 |\n| math.fsum | 3/3 | 0 |\n\n![三种固定输入下的精确命中数与最大绝对误差](figure:0)\n\n这组结果建立了顺序敏感性的直接证据：相同的小量可以在一种排列中保留，在另一种排列中逐次丢失。但它不能证明任意“小数先加”的排序都精确，也没有涉及非整数表示误差、溢出、下溢或计时。","requires_block_ids":["inputs"],"role":"results"}],"evidence_refs":[{"locator":"全文","relation":"input","revision":null,"sha256":"4259addfe1da6ca0b2736a05e02d3a662fdad3d6c842243e3818c99e120e34de","target_id":"SRC-SUMMATION-DETAIL-R01","target_kind":"file"},{"locator":"run.json","relation":"input","revision":null,"sha256":"3176d6c1d406d01e258d6a29340dd2d59da8dd4a133a00a615981184e4091106","target_id":"RUN-20260908T201214Z-D0AB308F66AD","target_kind":"owner"},{"locator":"run.json","relation":"input","revision":null,"sha256":"8efe2879a142667db6d174693fc5738228e9904902d7a2c884e720d75d014b05","target_id":"RUN-20260908T215458Z-04C7D84D40D8","target_kind":"owner"},{"locator":"全文","relation":"input","revision":null,"sha256":"83d97bbfcf42bdbbe3780df71d202033bc8cede38f197913da5d0b77f5f7cf45","target_id":"SRC-SUMMATION-INPUT-R01","target_kind":"file"},{"locator":"全文","relation":"input","revision":null,"sha256":"739d2ce2c6922dc7ce74dfea9ac22d987dd6b8d353484e70c615fc96d2f22074","target_id":"SRC-SUMMATION-TRACE-VERIFY","target_kind":"file"},{"locator":"全文","relation":"input","revision":null,"sha256":"d7348aca67bf17dc4369a7b8d756b2193571b8c6f7010cc0efb6557ef409da8c","target_id":"SRC-SUMMATION-OP-TRACES","target_kind":"file"},{"locator":"全文","relation":"input","revision":null,"sha256":"043d9bc1c51b300a97a2b915b5c53af73553f1d726b9936c9315a074220fbea8","target_id":"SRC-SUMMATION-FIGURE-R01","target_kind":"file"},{"locator":"全文","relation":"input","revision":null,"sha256":"bf89c9889ac3795214b21b6a3d19557750da1304fc60fb58d63d119784e7ceed","target_id":"SRC-SUMMATION-REPORT-V2-METHODS","target_kind":"file"},{"locator":"全文","relation":"input","revision":null,"sha256":"77941df3cdaf33546da7a65362918f07f00fd02196163e4992508444fe763d23","target_id":"SRC-SUMMATION-REPORT-V2-ROUND-01","target_kind":"file"},{"locator":"完整正文与固定依据","relation":"references","revision":1,"sha256":"ba12342c6ca8afa0a1760dc517fd7bff2d1b60c7f082ee9113e419572834df51","target_id":"MEM-4acc73bb-59c7-560d-9415-fd42e9dcaa2d","target_kind":"record"}],"figures":[{"caption":"第1轮精确命中数和最大绝对误差，横轴方法，误差无量纲","ref":{"locator":"全文","relation":"input","revision":null,"sha256":"043d9bc1c51b300a97a2b915b5c53af73553f1d726b9936c9315a074220fbea8","target_id":"SRC-SUMMATION-FIGURE-R01","target_kind":"file"}}],"missing_refs":[],"retrieval_description":{"applicable":["第1轮保存的构造输入、实现和环境。"],"key_findings":["逐项累加1/3精确，最大绝对误差1000；math.fsum为3/3、误差0。"],"limitations":["非整数、极端指数、跨平台和性能未验证；研究not-reviewed。"],"method":"读取对应固定构造输入，按已保存实现与精确有理数和比较；本文仅重新组织既有完整说明。","not_applicable":["任意输入的正确性或真实数据分布成功概率。"],"question":"输入顺序如何影响小量保存？"},"run_ref":{"locator":"run.json","relation":"input","revision":null,"sha256":"3176d6c1d406d01e258d6a29340dd2d59da8dd4a133a00a615981184e4091106","target_id":"RUN-20260908T201214Z-D0AB308F66AD","target_kind":"owner"},"unit_type":"experiment"},"previous_revision":3,"provenance_gap":null,"record_hash":"057444c965f88537bd84bd1fa15d550dc460e0f2bdc213255ddddf5e71f29a2c","record_id":"MEM-c52df8fb-ca9e-53a7-a49b-342592884a50","record_reason":"使本条正文脱离对话及相邻记录仍能理解问题、依据、结果和使用边界。","revision":4,"schema_version":3,"sensitivity":"internal","sources":[{"locator":"全文","relation":"input","revision":null,"sha256":"4259addfe1da6ca0b2736a05e02d3a662fdad3d6c842243e3818c99e120e34de","target_id":"SRC-SUMMATION-DETAIL-R01","target_kind":"file"},{"locator":"run.json","relation":"input","revision":null